  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: The most current build of the game is from 9/29/2026 and includes mostly
    visual improvements throughout the game's UI along with some bug fixes. More
    specificaly, the Main Menu has recieved updates to their buttons, introducing
    new animations that make them feel more responsive and has a newly animated logo.
    The Track Selection scene's buttons has also recieved new animations along with
    introducing new buttons that users can now use to set the AI Count and Lap Count.
    Additionally, the scene now has support for addtional tracks and, when introduced,
    user's can scroll and choose between maps (Track 2 as of 10/18/2026 currently
    is just a Placeholder image). Racer's UI in the Racetrack scene have also recieved
    several updates with a new, cleaner race timer, a functioning track map that
    keeps postion of racers throughout the race, the ability to switch from the newly
    added third person perspecrive to the previous first person perspective, and
    new timer features that show the user's the time it took to complete the previous
    lap upon new lap and, upon the end of the race, now shows racers all their completed
    lap times and the average time it took to complete a lap based on those lap times.
    Addtional fixes have been implemented to the AI Racer's navagation and they now
    clump up less and are able to better recover if they spin out during a race.
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
