  m_text: "The Fall 2026 team extended an inherited Unity codebase with major visual
    overhauls throughout the game's many scenes. Additionally, based on the requests
    by sponsors for the poject and testing done by the team, bug fixes were implemented
    throughout the game and the ability for continued-development remains open for
    future teams. \n\nResources used for the game were: Unity Engine 2023.2.22f1,
    C#, Visual Studio, Github (subject to change based on team feedback and final
    update)"
